          "category": "logic-error",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "FindBlockEnd skips braces inside quoted strings and comments, but treats braces in Terraform heredoc strings as block delimiters. Role_assignments_use_only_direct_resource_references uses the truncated body to check principal_id and scope.",
            "failureScenario": "If a valid role assignment has a heredoc description containing `}` before its direct principal_id and scope attributes, the parser ends the block early and the contract test reports those attributes missing."
